[I] Library for encoding and decoding .avif files

[T] This library aims to be a friendly, portable C implementation of the AV1
[T] Image File Format, as described here:

[U] https://github.com/AOMediaCodec/libavif

[A] Joe Drago
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

[L] BSD
[V] 1.4.2
[P] X -----5---9 124.610

[D] ffacfcc27217a2d6dfbf913c7539f73c9cf3fbe7e779ea9ddb526b77 libavif-1.4.2.tar.gz https://github.com/AOMediaCodec/libavif/archive/v1.4.2/
[D] 7fb8875b3f43bc5689b01eeb8a1d2cf6504cdb900cbc4ffddb9fca06 libargparse-ee74d1b.tar.gz git+https://github.com/kmurray/libargparse ee74d1b53bd680748af14e737378de57e2a0a954

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DAVIF_BUILD_APPS=ON
var_append cmakeopt ' ' '-DAVIF_CODEC_DAV1D=ON -DAVIF_CODEC_RAV1E=ON'

# pinned libargparse for avifgainmaputil, no system package exists
hook_add preconf 5 "tar $taropt \$(match_source_file -p libargparse) -C ext"
